Yaap one of two

I have been going nuts playing nethack on the NAO server. I had
stopped playing for about half a year but Octobers tourny got me
hooked again, and i have ascended about 4 classes in that time. They
were even consecutive games.  I was going for 5 in a row but
yesterday i got killed twice with in the very early game due to
carelessness, so i took a small break. 

I took notes for all 4 games but only the last two spring to mind
well. 
I will note however that i have been dismayed by how long it takes me
to complete a game. my fastest game was probably about 90,000 turns
and it is not unusual for me to take about 130,000 turns to finish.
This is way too long, especially if i want a shot at completing more
than two games at dev.null next year. So in this set i emphasized
speed. I even started genociding for the first time since 1987 (or 86
or 88, back when i was playing hack.)
so here is my turn count for the 4 games + the one before.
crazy the  tourist  73130 (yaap posted in December)
crazy the priest     69885 (first of the set of 4 and start of
genociding. Only L though)
crazy the sam       56973 (only L again)
crazy the wiz        46716  
crazy the barb       33990 (first time i played like a non spellcaster
in nethack without conducts)



